Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.41,0:00:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.95,0:00:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU! YAMU! YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.57,0:00:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.01,0:00:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Your moves!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.07,0:01:12.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What a lovely day this is for a duel,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.45,0:01:15.11,Default,,0,0,0,,especially on an occasion\Nsuch as this when two
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.19,0:01:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,,old friends are battling\Nit out to the very end.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.17,0:01:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,It's challenges like this that puts\Nto the test the ties that bind us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.61,0:01:25.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter to me who wins or loses,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.15,0:01:29.65,Default,,0,0,0,,because in the end I know it is\NI who shall emerge victorious.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.99,0:01:33.43,Default,,0,0,0,,And you, young Yugi,\Nwho shall be vanquished.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.79,0:01:37.71,Default,,0,0,0,,The game is really too close.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.03,0:01:40.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, they're both playing\Nat the top of their form.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.55,0:01:42.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, either one of them could win.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.63,0:01:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.54,0:01:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think I've ever\Nseen such an exciting duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.21,0:01:48.21,Default,,0,0,0,,And who would have thought\Nthat at this point,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.29,0:01:50.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey would have more life\Npoints left than Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.63,0:01:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Truly extraordinary.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.29,0:01:57.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead and toss it, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.15,0:01:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't surprise me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.61,0:02:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I know your cards by heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.17,0:02:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,True.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.08,0:02:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll also know it's my favorite.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.63,0:02:06.11,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's one of my most powerful cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.29,0:02:08.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Dark Magician! Attack mode!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.91,0:02:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Figures.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.82,0:02:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You always count on the Dark\NMagician when you're in a tight spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.07,0:02:14.13,Default,,0,0,0,,But not this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.33,0:02:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Even he's no match for my Skull Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.87,0:02:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.01,0:02:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,In a duel, the monster with the\Nlowest attack strength loses.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.81,0:02:25.27,Default,,0,0,0,,That's one of the first lessons you ever\Ntaught me about Duel Monsters, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.35,0:02:27.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Your past has come back to haunt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.41,0:02:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see who spooks whom. Don't forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.21,0:02:32.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I also taught you how\Nto protect your weaker
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.63,0:02:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,monsters by enhancing\Nthem with magic cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.31,0:02:36.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.65,0:02:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what's coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.35,0:02:42.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Magical hats, protect and\Nconceal the Dark Magician.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.69,0:02:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I usually like this trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.43,0:02:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Good move.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.57,0:02:50.85,Default,,0,0,0,,That'll sure slow Joey down big time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.89,0:02:54.39,Default,,0,0,0,,My hat's off to you, Yugi boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.21,0:02:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your pick, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.23,0:03:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,So tell me, which hat do you\Nthink is hiding the Dark Magician?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.93,0:03:05.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I was hoping to end this duel\Nbefore he drew the magical hats.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.63,0:03:10.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I gotta depend on luck, not dueling\Nskill, to help me find his Dark Magician.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.17,0:03:11.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, pick a hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.49,0:03:16.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, guess I just gotta\Ntake him down one at a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.41,0:03:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.32,0:03:19.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Molten fireballs!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.97,0:03:23.93,Default,,0,0,0,,One down.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.17,0:03:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,From the looks of\Nthings, you picked wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.75,0:03:32.99,Default,,0,0,0,,That leaves three. Nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.21,0:03:35.57,Default,,0,0,0,,This'll give you another\Nturn to fight back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.65,0:03:37.77,Default,,0,0,0,,That may have been Joey's last shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.17,0:03:40.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Whenever a duelist gives\NYugi time to recover,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.81,0:03:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,he always comes back stronger than ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.97,0:03:45.51,Default,,0,0,0,,But if Joey loses, how\Ncan he save his sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.59,0:03:49.15,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter who wins this game,\Nsomebody loses everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.53,0:04:00.17,Default,,0,0,0,,So now that your attack on\Nmy Dark Magician has failed,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.25,0:04:03.63,Default,,0,0,0,,is there any other play you want\Nto make before I end your turn?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.71,0:04:06.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that you mention it, I did\Nhave one more move in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.85,0:04:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope I'm doing the right\Nthing here by playing his card.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.33,0:04:13.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, it could be a mistake,\Nbut I play Garuzis in attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.19,0:04:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Your turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.15,0:04:20.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Why play that card?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.01,0:04:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.03,0:04:23.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What could I have been thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.49,0:04:26.27,Default,,0,0,0,,The Dark Magician has an\Nattack power of 2,500.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.01,0:04:31.01,Default,,0,0,0,,And Garoozies only has an\Nattack strength of 1,800. Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.39,0:04:34.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess you have no choice\Nbut to attack Garoozies.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.23,0:04:37.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm almost giving you the game, but\NI got no one to blame but myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.71,0:04:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,So go ahead, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.91,0:04:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring it on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.83,0:04:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack me with your Dark Magician.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.37,0:04:44.55,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what I get for my bonehead move.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.63,0:04:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.77,0:04:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,An attack would bring Joey\Ndown to 50 life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.95,0:04:53.53,Default,,0,0,0,,But it would also draw\Nout the Dark Magician,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.61,0:04:56.57,Default,,0,0,0,,which would let Joey counterattack\Nwith his black skull,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.65,0:04:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,wiping out all of Yugi's life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.87,0:04:59.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.79,0:05:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring it on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.70,0:05:02.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't stop your attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.43,0:05:04.47,Default,,0,0,0,,That bluff might have\Nworked on somebody else,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.55,0:05:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,but not somebody who's\Nknown him as long as I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.99,0:05:09.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Joey, but I'm not\Ngoing to fall for that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.51,0:05:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Instead, I'll put this card inside one\Nof the magical hats and end my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.33,0:05:16.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, he was too smart for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.51,0:05:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to pick another hat, Joey. Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.11,0:05:22.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Now he's got something else hidden\Nunder those hats I gotta worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.81,0:05:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,And knowing Yugi, it's probably a trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.51,0:05:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,But wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.42,0:05:28.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi knows me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.53,0:05:31.33,Default,,0,0,0,,And he would know that I would\Nknow that he's laying a trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.41,0:05:33.75,Default,,0,0,0,,So maybe he didn't play a trap after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.83,0:05:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's a monster card instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.11,0:05:40.71,Default,,0,0,0,,But what if he knows that I would think\Nthat, so it really is a trap card?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.79,0:05:44.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Except if he knows that I know,\Nthat he knows what I know...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.65,0:05:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.56,0:05:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just gonna attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.11,0:05:50.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Black Skull Dragon, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.41,0:05:53.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Molten Fireballs!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.17,0:06:05.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing. I missed again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.93,0:06:08.79,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the way life goes, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.87,0:06:10.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Never as you've planned.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.89,0:06:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,The world is a very\Narbitrary place, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.19,0:06:17.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a place where you can be locked\Nin battle with your dearest friend,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.57,0:06:20.47,Default,,0,0,0,,for stakes neither can afford to lose. Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.57,0:06:22.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you'd like to think\Nthat your friendship would be
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.61,0:06:25.79,Default,,0,0,0,,enough to sustain you through\Nany mishap or misfortune,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.87,0:06:28.83,Default,,0,0,0,,but that's not the way\Nthe world works. No,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.03,0:06:32.59,Default,,0,0,0,,the world is a place where fate\Nintervenes when you least expect it,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.67,0:06:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,with consequences that can\Nturn your world upside down.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.17,0:06:39.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Just when you think you've\Netched the perfect portrait
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.43,0:06:42.55,Default,,0,0,0,,of your future and your life\Ncouldn't get any better.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.75,0:06:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Just when you let down your guard\Nat last and open your heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.19,0:06:48.73,Default,,0,0,0,,When against all odds,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.87,0:06:51.43,Default,,0,0,0,,you've found that one\Nspecial person in all
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.51,0:06:54.15,Default,,0,0,0,,the world that fills your heart with joy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.03,0:06:58.87,Default,,0,0,0,,The person you know you are destined\Nto spend the rest of your life with.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.95,0:07:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,That's when tragedy strikes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.11,0:07:06.07,Default,,0,0,0,,When fate hits you with a cold slap\Nof reality and shows you who's boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.33,0:07:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, the world has taught me that only\Nthe strong and the ruthless survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.69,0:07:17.81,Default,,0,0,0,,In memory of all I have lost, I fight on\Nwith all I possess, and I intend to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.51,0:07:20.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna miss this time, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.83,0:07:22.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna blast your dark magician.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.25,0:07:24.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Dragon, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.09,0:07:26.57,Default,,0,0,0,,The hat on the far left!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.05,0:07:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Go now, Molten Fireball!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.05,0:07:50.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You activated my trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.87,0:07:52.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Spellbinding circle.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.39,0:07:56.63,Default,,0,0,0,,That dropped my skull's attack points.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.83,0:07:58.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Now he's vulnerable to an attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.91,0:08:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't risk both my monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.13,0:08:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Garoozy's defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.79,0:08:05.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you're on the defensive,\Nand it's a nice change.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.59,0:08:10.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi's Spellbinding Circle has\Nwiped out Joey's attack advantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.29,0:08:13.15,Default,,0,0,0,,No doubt about that, but\Nit's still a close match.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.23,0:08:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You said it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.14,0:08:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi could attack with the Dark Magician.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.53,0:08:19.21,Default,,0,0,0,,But what good would that\Nattack really do him?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.29,0:08:23.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Both the Dark Magician and the Skull\NDragon have equal attack strengths.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.35,0:08:24.57,Default,,0,0,0,,As strong as they are,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.65,0:08:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,a battle between the two of them\Nwould just result in a standoff.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.79,0:08:29.03,Default,,0,0,0,,A stalemate, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.37,0:08:33.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Somehow, one of them is going to have to\Ndo something to tip things in their favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.71,0:08:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.79,0:08:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.77,0:08:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi's the toughest\Nopponent I've ever faced.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.15,0:08:40.23,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'll beat him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.61,0:08:42.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey's really learned a\Nlot the past few weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.87,0:08:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,He plays like a pro.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.09,0:08:47.89,Default,,0,0,0,,But in the duel against Pegasus, it's\Ngoing to take more than an expert duelist.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.97,0:08:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It's going to take someone who can also
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.61,0:08:52.15,Default,,0,0,0,,stand up to the power\Nof his Millennium Item.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.23,0:08:56.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, you've dueled well, but the\Ntide of this battle is about to turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.71,0:08:58.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Most impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.23,0:09:01.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Despite the bond that these two share,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.39,0:09:04.07,Default,,0,0,0,,My Millennium Eye tells\Nme that they are indeed
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.15,0:09:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,dueling each other with\Neverything they've got.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.13,0:09:10.53,Default,,0,0,0,,With my grandpa's soul at\Nstake, I really have no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.77,0:09:11.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to win this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.33,0:09:13.27,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.47,0:09:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.65,0:09:17.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to obliterate\Nyour dragon. You what?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.27,0:09:20.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm ready for you. Bring it on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.19,0:09:26.41,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.67,0:09:31.03,Default,,0,0,0,,The card I drew will vanquish your\Nskull dragon once and for all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.39,0:09:56.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I play the Book of Secret Arts,\Nand with its ancient magic,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.49,0:09:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,my Dark Magician becomes 300\N100 attack points stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.73,0:10:07.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Dark Magician!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.99,0:10:10.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack the Black Skull Dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.41,0:10:19.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, Black Skull is beaten.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.09,0:10:21.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Excellent work, Yugi-Boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.09,0:10:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You took out his very best monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.53,0:10:31.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, I was counting on that Black\NSkull Dragon to win this duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.31,0:10:35.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, not only is he gone, but I got a\Nsouped-up Dark Magician to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.31,0:10:37.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey's kept me down all match long.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.01,0:10:40.21,Default,,0,0,0,,But now I finally have the advantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.83,0:10:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Not only is my Dark Magician\N300 points stronger than normal,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.91,0:10:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,but he's ready to show off\Na few hidden powers, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.01,0:10:50.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.29,0:10:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,He really got slammed there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.81,0:10:54.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You think this duel's over for him?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.81,0:10:57.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it depends on what he does next.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.19,0:10:58.19,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.57,0:11:02.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Losing that Black Skull Dragon was a\Nheavy loss, but not a critical one.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.55,0:11:07.07,Default,,0,0,0,,If Joey can just pull himself\Ntogether, he can still win this duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.93,0:11:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, how could I go from top of the\Nheap to down in the dumps in one turn?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.63,0:11:14.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm never gonna win now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.97,0:11:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.85,0:11:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Serenity.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.01,0:11:20.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, I miss you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.53,0:11:21.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't forget me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.37,0:11:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Pinky Swim? Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.31,0:11:26.49,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll always look out for each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.95,0:11:30.07,Default,,0,0,0,,What am I thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.39,0:11:31.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.53,0:11:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,My sister's counting on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.13,0:11:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter how bad things look,\NI gotta keep fighting for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.25,0:11:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.97,0:11:46.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Part of the cards, don't fail me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.33,0:11:50.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.71,0:11:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.87,0:11:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.03,0:11:59.53,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Yu-Gi, time\Nto kiss the baby. Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.11,0:12:02.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Baby dragon, attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.91,0:12:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.15,0:12:08.97,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm laying this down, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.99,0:12:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.90,0:12:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That second card Joey threw\Nmust be the Time Wizard.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.89,0:12:18.49,Default,,0,0,0,,He always plays them together.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.57,0:12:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to do something\Nbefore he activates its
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.47,0:12:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,magic and warps that baby\Ndragon into its adult form.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.29,0:12:28.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Joey, but my Dark Magician\Nwill destroy your baby dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.33,0:12:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Dark Magic Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.83,0:12:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Yug, but you just\Nwalked into a trap. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.33,0:12:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead and let him have it, Garoozies.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.09,0:12:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Kunai with Chain!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.53,0:12:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.27,0:12:50.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Clever move.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.45,0:12:54.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey knew I was expecting the Time\NWizard, so he threw a trap instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.21,0:12:58.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Shame on you, Yugi boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.31,0:13:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Using the knowledge you have of Joey's\Ndeck to predict what card he would play.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.53,0:13:04.17,Default,,0,0,0,,And to no avail, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.45,0:13:07.85,Default,,0,0,0,,At least when I prophesize\Ncards, I'm always right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.29,0:13:15.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Yug, I'd say that last move brings\Nus to the homestretch, wouldn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.17,0:13:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I would.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.08,0:13:17.97,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, Joey,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.25,0:13:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,let's finish this match and find out\Nwhich one of us will duel against Pegasus.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.93,0:13:27.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Yug. Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.95,0:13:30.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Just know it's been a\Nreal honor dueling you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.57,0:13:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Likewise.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.85,0:13:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,How cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.33,0:13:37.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Even now, in the midst of\Nbattle, they're friends first.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.13,0:13:41.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I know neither of us want to\Nlose this match, but if I do,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.23,0:13:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad it was to you, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.43,0:13:47.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's do like you said,\NYugi, and finish this duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.73,0:13:51.03,Default,,0,0,0,,And maybe this draw will do just that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.47,0:13:53.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess it's just one way to find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.85,0:13:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Here goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.37,0:14:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Unreal!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.28,0:14:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I pulled the one card\Nin my whole deck that
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.45,0:14:05.03,Default,,0,0,0,,really can finish this\Nduel and decide a winner.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.11,0:14:07.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean you pulled? That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.85,0:14:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,The Time Wizard.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.65,0:14:11.93,Default,,0,0,0,,The Time Wizard?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.17,0:14:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Kind of strange that this is all\Ncoming down to a card that you gave me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.41,0:14:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, Joy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.79,0:14:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Add this to your deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.75,0:14:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It can be helpful in a tight spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.39,0:14:25.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow. Thanks, Yuge.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.91,0:14:28.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You're always being such a pal to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.69,0:14:31.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You were right, Yuge.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.15,0:14:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,That card you gave me saved my Kista\Nquite a few times in this tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.41,0:14:40.07,Default,,0,0,0,,And now with my baby dragon on the field\Nand both of us just life points away from
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.15,0:14:42.05,Default,,0,0,0,,winning or losing this duel I'm gonna give
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.13,0:14:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,it one last spin and\Nhope it saves me again
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.65,0:14:48.71,Default,,0,0,0,,So cross your fingers and\Nget set to adjust your
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.79,0:14:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,clocks because here it\Ncomes Go time roulette
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.87,0:15:09.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Time Warp.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.55,0:15:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, jackpot.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.05,0:15:22.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Time Warp.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.71,0:15:23.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Time magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.13,0:15:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.05,0:15:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Yug, but I'm afraid my Time Warp that has\Nmade the Dark Magician a sickly old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.03,0:15:38.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at the Dark Magician!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.91,0:15:40.79,Default,,0,0,0,,He's aged like a thousand years.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.97,0:15:42.85,Default,,0,0,0,,He's no match for Joey's dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.37,0:15:48.43,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.85,0:15:50.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I can hardly believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.11,0:15:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.63,0:15:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm really gonna do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.71,0:15:59.35,Default,,0,0,0,,All I gotta do is attack, and\NI'll have actually beat Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.89,0:16:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna win! Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.21,0:16:04.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Noxious Nostril Gust!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.41,0:16:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I counter with Makiyou, the Magical Mist!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.55,0:16:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.46,0:16:15.35,Default,,0,0,0,,My attack's getting smothered.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.23,0:16:18.43,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.61,0:16:22.71,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you play Magic while it\Nwas still my turn? With magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.97,0:16:27.61,Default,,0,0,0,,A magic so powerful that it took my dark\Nmagician a thousand years to learn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.69,0:16:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Say, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.73,0:16:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,That time warp did age my dark magician.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.21,0:16:34.65,Default,,0,0,0,,But it made him stronger, not weaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.17,0:16:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,And with age comes great wisdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.97,0:16:43.19,Default,,0,0,0,,A thousand years of wisdom that have\Ntransformed him into the Dark Sage.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.87,0:16:48.67,Default,,0,0,0,,An ultimate magician whose new\Npowers let me play one magic
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.75,0:16:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,card during every one of your\Nturns and every one of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.27,0:16:55.21,Default,,0,0,0,,And the magic card I chose\Nto counter your attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.49,0:16:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Magician, the Magical Mist!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.73,0:16:59.73,Default,,0,0,0,,With its enchanted\Nrainfall upon the field,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.81,0:17:03.87,Default,,0,0,0,,your dragon's smoke stream was\Nneutralized before it reached my mage.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.47,0:17:10.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I invoke his powers for my\Nturn and draw this magic card.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.07,0:17:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You fought a valiant duel, my friend,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.33,0:17:20.33,Default,,0,0,0,,and this is the hardest\Nmove I've ever had to make.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.55,0:17:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,But this ends now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.45,0:17:28.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I play Monster Reborn and call the Black\NSkull Dragon back from the graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.97,0:17:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.59,0:17:38.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, go for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.13,0:17:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It's cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.85,0:17:43.93,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Black Skull Dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.79,0:17:47.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Molten Fireball attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.65,0:18:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I tell you, that was\Nreally tough to watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.53,0:18:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.44,0:18:11.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, just imagine how\Nthose two must be feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.23,0:18:13.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just glad it's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.97,0:18:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm so proud of them both.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.19,0:18:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,They duel their hardest, but never\Nonce forgot their friendship.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.07,0:18:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.98,0:18:26.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, touching as that may be, you really\Nought to save your tears, little girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.69,0:18:30.93,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, you'll be needing them\Nonce I face Yugi in the dueling arena.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.63,0:18:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Yugi, we knew one of us had to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.55,0:18:40.49,Default,,0,0,0,,But the good news is that\None of us got to win, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.57,0:18:41.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Congratulations, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.11,0:18:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, this is yours now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.11,0:18:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.53,0:18:46.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.69,0:18:48.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You show Croquet his card. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.79,0:18:51.51,Default,,0,0,0,,And he'll give you three\Nmillion bucks in prize money.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.59,0:18:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.91,0:18:54.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You should keep it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.35,0:18:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Your sister needs that money.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.15,0:18:59.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuge, I didn't enter into this\Ntournament to get rich, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.43,0:19:02.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just here to save my\Ngrandpa and the Kaiba brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.59,0:19:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, use this money\Nfor Serenity's operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.85,0:19:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.29,0:19:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.79,0:19:10.21,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you say, Joey?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.51,0:19:12.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's what you've been wanting, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.79,0:19:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at him, always playing the tough guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.03,0:19:23.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, when I lost the duel, I\Nlost all hope of saving my sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.49,0:19:26.63,Default,,0,0,0,,But now, Yugi, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.19,0:19:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Now go and take down Pegasus.
